WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:02.380
- [Announcer] This is pizza.

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.250
Now before you pizza purists
destroy us in the comments,

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.120
please open your mind and let me explain.

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.223
This is Zanzibar pizza.

00:00:16.969 --> 00:00:19.802
(whimsical music)

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:33.920
- [Announcer] Meet Muhamedi.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.400
He is the best pizza maker in Zanzibar

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.320
and is pretty well known
around his hometown.

00:00:45.822 --> 00:00:49.239
Oh, I didn't know I was with a celebrity.

00:00:51.661 --> 00:00:53.400
Anyway, Muhamedi is a fixture

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.590
at the Forodhani Garden Night Market,

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:58.843
making pizza both sweet and
savory for over 10 years.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.760
Every morning Muhamedi
goes to the local market

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.770
for the very best and fresh ingredients

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:15.191
in order to make his one of a kind

00:01:15.191 --> 00:01:17.603
homemade Zanzibar pizza pies.

00:01:41.336 --> 00:01:44.400
The dough for Zanzibar
pizza is actually chapati,

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.143
an unleavened bread, which
is also made by hand.

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.613
Ooh, that sounds good.

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:18.873
And that, my friends, is
pizza - Zanzibar pizza.

